  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia Awards Papua New Guinea (AAPNG)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia Awards Papua New Guinea (AAPNG) provides long and short-term scholarships to future Papua New Guinea (PNG) leaders to study in Australia and PNG, in priority areas identified by the PNG and Australian Governments. AAPNG also provides capacity-building support to PNG partner tertiary institutions (PTIs), support for alumni engagement and twinning arrangements between PNG and Australian universities. PNG sees the tangible benefits of the Australia Awards, with alumni holding leadership positions in PNG&#x2019;s public service and working as senior managers, business owners, health workers and teachers.</narrative>
  </description>
